1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:02,300
What if you never stopped playing Roblox?

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:04,680
Not for dinner, not for bed, never.

3
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,780
Sweetie, time to stop playing.

4
00:00:07,039 --> 00:00:07,500
Can't.

5
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:08,960
I'm on a win streak.

6
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,520
Day one, dinner.

7
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,760
Spaghetti in one hand, tablet in the other.

8
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:15,180
Day two, mom hides the tablet.

9
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,000
So, you play on the microwave.

10
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,000
Day three, you play in the shower, in

11
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:20,920
a plastic bag.

12
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:24,060
Day four, you fall asleep and keep playing

13
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:24,980
in your sleep.

14
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:27,260
96 hours straight.

15
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,520
New world record.

16
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:31,619
Everyone who subscribes gets unlimited screen time.

17
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:35,800
Day five, mom shuts off the power for

18
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:36,900
the whole house.

19
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:38,780
So, you switch to your phone.

20
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,080
1% battery.

21
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:42,160
Please, take a break.

22
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,940
Even the servers are tired.

23
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,020
Fine, I'll stop.

24
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:49,600
Comment one more if you'd never stop either.

25
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:52,200
Okay, one more game.
